    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9a8af5fdf588a508fb55f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "离比赛开始还有一段时间。\n保险起见，我回头看向跟在我后头的她，\n打算再重新确认一次作战计划──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1c4f222e130f01e227daaec383620e7276f1fe433ccb98216d71caf8d0af7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
